{"id":54959,"mal_id":54959,"title":"BanG Dream! It's MyGO!!!!!","englishTitle":null,"title_english":null,"alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"","ja":"バンドリ！It's MyGO!!!!!"},"synopsis":"In their last year of middle school, the five band members of CRYCHIC went their separate ways after an unpleasant disbandment. Each wrestling with their own regrets, the girls enrolled in different high schools, hoping never to hear from one another again.\n\nMeanwhile, Anon Chihaya transfers to Haneoka Girls' Academy in the middle of the school year. As most students play in a band as a hobby, Anon desires to fit in and spends her first days trying to recruit members for her own band, envisioning herself as the group's vocalist. She befriends Tomori Takamatsu, a shy girl who seems interested but hesitant about joining. As it turns out, Tomori used to be part of CRYCHIC, an experience that has scarred her deeply.\n\nThrough Tomori, Anon meets Taki Shiina and Soyo Nagasaki, both former members of the same band. Although Taki detests the idea of playing with Anon, Soyo is delighted to help her out. Now with Soyo by her side, Anon's dream of forming a band is within reach—if only she could find a few more members.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"En su último año de escuela secundaria, los cinco miembros de la banda CRYCHIC tomaron caminos separados después de una desagradable disolución. Cada una luchando con sus propios arrepentimientos, las chicas se matricularon en diferentes escuelas secundarias, con la esperanza de no volver a saber nunca más una de la otra.\n\nMientras tanto, Anon Chihaya se transfiere a la Academia de Niñas Haneoka a mediados del año escolar. Como la mayoría de los estudiantes tocan en una banda como pasatiempo, Anon desea encajar y pasa sus primeros días tratando de reclutar miembros para su propia banda, imaginándose a sí misma como la vocalista del grupo. Se hace amiga de Tomori Takamatsu, una chica tímida que parece interesada pero reacia a unirse. Resulta que Tomori solía ser parte de CRYCHIC, una experiencia que la ha marcado profundamente.\n\nA través de Tomori, Anon conoce a Taki Shiina y Soyo Nagasaki, ambos ex miembros de la misma banda. Aunque Taki detesta la idea de jugar con Anon, Soyo está encantada de ayudarla. Ahora con Soyo a su lado, el sueño de Anon de formar una banda está a su alcance, si tan solo pudiera encontrar algunos miembros más.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1420,"average_episode_duration":1420,"startDate":"2023-06-29","start_date":"2023-06-29","endDate":"2023-09-14","end_date":"2023-09-14","season":"summer","year":2023,"start_season":{"year":2023,"season":"summer"},"episodes":13,"num_episodes":13,"score":8.25,"mean":8.25,"numListUsers":45921,"num_list_users":45921,"genres":[{"id":8,"name":"Drama"},{"id":19,"name":"Music"}],"studios":[{"id":537,"name":"SANZIGEN"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1891/136948.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1891/136948l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1891/136948.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1891/136948l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1891/136948l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"thursday","time":"23:00","day_of_the_week":"thursday","start_time":"23:00","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"thursday 23:00"},"rank":388,"popularity":3914,"rating":"pg_13","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":22442,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2023-04-09T10:44:02+00:00","updated_at":"2025-03-27T16:23:00+00:00","source":"mixed_media","background":null,"related_anime":[{"node":{"id":33573,"title":"BanG Dream!","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimel